  data: {
    LLM: "First round: Player with 3 Spades starts. Subsequent: Winner of last round starts. Play combination (Single, Pair, Triple, Run). Next player must beat it with same type and higher rank/suit. Pass = out for the trick. 2s are high. 'Bombs' (4-of-a-kind, double runs) can beat 2s out of turn (Chopping). Winner is first out. Others play for 2nd, etc., or game ends.",
    Player: "First round: Player with 3 Spades starts. Subsequent: Winner of last round starts. Play combination (Single, Pair, Triple, Run). Next player must beat it with same type and higher rank/suit. Pass = out for the trick. 2s are high. 'Bombs' (4-of-a-kind, double runs) can beat 2s out of turn (Chopping). Winner is first out. Others play for 2nd, etc., or game ends.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to shed all cards from your hand; the last player left holding any cards loses the game.',
